{"page":154,"width":1809,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"208","words":[{"text":"208","x":170,"y":126,"width":67,"height":31}]},{"text":"Chapter 4 스레드와 병행성","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":322,"y":130,"width":137,"height":33},{"text":"4","x":475,"y":135,"width":24,"height":23},{"text":"스레드와","x":532,"y":135,"width":103,"height":27},{"text":"병행성","x":645,"y":137,"width":72,"height":29}]},{"text":"ynchronous procedure calls, APC)이리는 것을 시용해서 이를 대리 실행(emulate)","words":[{"text":"ynchronous","x":320,"y":275,"width":221,"height":41},{"text":"procedure","x":556,"y":277,"width":183,"height":42},{"text":"calls,","x":753,"y":278,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"APC)이리는","x":857,"y":277,"width":209,"height":42},{"text":"것을","x":1083,"y":278,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"시용해서","x":1168,"y":280,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"이를","x":1331,"y":282,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"대리","x":1421,"y":283,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"실행(emulate)","x":1513,"y":281,"width":235,"height":53}]},{"text":"할 수 있다. APC는 시용자 스레드들이 특정 이벤트의 빌쟁을 전달받았을 때 호출될 함","words":[{"text":"할","x":320,"y":336,"width":39,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":372,"y":337,"width":38,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":427,"y":338,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"APC는","x":521,"y":341,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"시용자","x":658,"y":338,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"스레드들이","x":777,"y":339,"width":174,"height":40},{"text":"특정","x":970,"y":342,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"이벤트의","x":1058,"y":341,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"빌쟁을","x":1217,"y":343,"width":111,"height":39},{"text":"전달받았을","x":1344,"y":345,"width":192,"height":39},{"text":"때","x":1552,"y":345,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"호출될","x":1603,"y":344,"width":103,"height":41},{"text":"함","x":1721,"y":354,"width":29,"height":38}]},{"text":"수를 지정할 수 있게 한다. 이름이 의미하는 비의 같이 APC는 UNIX의 비동기식 신호","words":[{"text":"수를","x":320,"y":401,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"지정할","x":410,"y":402,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":532,"y":403,"widt